      55.17,
      400.38,
      295.22,
      445.74
    ],
    "text": "I, Gayantha Karunatilake, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the lands described below is needed for apublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.17,
      455.22,
      295.2,
      532.98
    ],
    "text": "The allotments of land called \u2018\u2018Kandehena\u2019\u2019 in extent of about0.0766 Hectare depicted in Advanced Tracing No. KE/GLG/2016/253 and dated 25.05.2017, prepared by Surveyor General situated inthe Villages of Kobbewela in the Grama Niladhari Division ofNo. 71, Kobbewela in the Kandupita Pattuwa \u2013 North Minor Divisionin the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Galigamuwa in KegalleDistrict in Sabaragamuwa Province and bounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.0
    ]
  },
